{"subjectId":"cryptography","id":"diagrams","title":"System Diagrams","group":"Analysis & Safety","order":9,"html":"<p class=\"lead\">Text diagrams detailing secure handshakes and persistent message flows.</p>\n<section class=\"block\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-key-visualizer\"></i>1. Key Exchange Handshake (ECDH)</h3>\n<figure class=\"code\"><pre><code>User A (Private a, Pub A=aG)                     User B (Private b, Pub B=bG)\n      |                                                |\n      |------------ [1. Upload PubKey A] -------------&gt;| (Server Store)\n      |                                                |\n      |&lt;----------- [2. Download PubKey B] ------------| (Server Retrieval)\n      |                                                |\n      |-- Derives shared secret S = a * Pub B (abG) ---|\n      |-- Runs through HKDF -&gt; Symmetric Session Key --|</code></pre></figure>\n</section>\n<section class=\"block\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-message\"></i>2. Message Flow Routing Lifecycle</h3>\n<figure class=\"code\"><pre><code>+---------+         +---------+         +-----------+         +--------+\n| ClientA |         | Backend |         |  Database |         |ClientB |\n+---------+         +---------+         +-----------+         +--------+\n     |                   |                    |                    |\n     |--[AES Encrypt]    |                    |                    |\n     |                   |                    |                    |\n     |--- websocket ----&gt;|                    |                    |\n     |    {ct, iv, tag}  |                    |                    |\n     |                   |-- db.insert ------&gt;|                    |\n     |                   |   {ct, iv, tag}    |                    |\n     |                   |                    |                    |\n     |                   |----------- websocket --------------&gt;|\n     |                   |            {ct, iv, tag}            |\n     |                   |                                     |\n     |                   |                                [AES Decrypt]\n     |                   |&lt;---------- ack delivery ------------|\n     |&lt;-- ack delivery --|                                     |</code></pre></figure>\n</section>"}